the aruba directory is for items that belong to enterprises.14823 (aruba)

aruba wired products fall under enterpises.47196 (hpe)



aruba:
    ArubaOS 7.2.0.0 and AP80-PRIVATE-MIB

    aruba.my and aruba-instant.my: Aruba Instant 8.13.3.0_96306
    Source: https://github.com/netdisco/snmp-info/issues/576
    https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32048165/aruba-instant-mibs_8.13.3.0_96306.tar.gz

* aruba.my (ARUBA-MIB) does not have a parsable version strings. compare by hand and
overwrite as needed.

* aruba-instant.my (AI-AP-MIB) does not seem to update it's revision string. also
compare by hand & overwrite if needed.

2026 refresh: selected wireless/controller vendor modules from
aruba-mibs_8.13.3.0_96306.tar.gz, supplied from HPE support. Includes the
previously absent WLSX-HA-MIB. ARUBA-MIB and AI-AP-MIB already match the
8.13.3.0 bundle and are left unchanged. Bundled standard MIBs are not
imported. WLSX-VOICE-MIB retains historical definitions omitted by the
vendor update.
